# Work Simulation

## Big Picture
- discrete event simulator
- answers what changes (what point in the system) when we change different resource variables
- program to simulate how long things would take with randomness factors
- uses comparable interfaces to schedule things
- hospital er example to see how many resources are needed to process patients effectively

