## Hospital Events Plan w/ descriptions
- patient arrival
  - uses 1 room
  - patient waits random amount of time
  - schedules nurse triage
- nurse triage
  - uses 1 nurse
  - patient is assigned random level of severity (critical, urgent, non-urgent)
  - schedules discharge or doctor consultation
- doctor consultation
  - uses 1 doctor
  - patient can either leave w/ medication or get admitted to further care
  - schedules discharge or further care
- further care (inpatient ward)
  - uses 1 further care room
  - for a longer amount of time
- free resource
  - frees any type of resource
  - also discharges patients
